  "notes": "升级更稳，连接诊断更准\n\n- 升级包无法写入时及时结束下载，避免进度长时间停住；取消下载和安装包完整性校验继续有效。\n- Windows 刚连接时会再次确认新出现的网卡，减少由过早检测引起的重复重连；网卡确实缺失或检测失败时仍显示对应状态。\n- 修复 AnyTLS 空闲连接清理的并发异常，保持现有网络栈和连接策略。\n",
  "notesEn": "Smoother updates and clearer connection checks\n\n- Downloads stop promptly when the update package cannot be written, avoiding a stalled progress display. Cancellation and package integrity checks remain effective.\n- Windows connection checks confirm an adapter that appears during startup again, reducing repeated reconnections caused by an early snapshot. Missing adapters and failed checks still show their respective states.\n- Fix an AnyTLS idle connection cleanup race while preserving the current network stack and connection policy.\n",
